{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55621","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十九 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山一坐万缘休，努力应须与古俦。\n散诞襟怀因绝趣，消疎活计爲无求。\n花明小砌和春月，松暗前轩带雨秋。\n景像自开还自合，怡然何必更忘忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}